<p>
Use authorized medicine take-back or collection
programs where available. Follow local disposal
instructions rather than flushing medicines into water.
</p>

</div>


<div class="solution">

<div style="font-size:40px;">🧑‍⚕️</div>

<h3>Use Medicines Responsibly</h3>

<p>
Take medicines according to professional medical
advice and avoid unnecessary use or sharing of
prescription medicines.
</p>

</div>


<div class="solution">

<div style="font-size:40px;">🏥</div>

<h3>Healthcare Waste Management</h3>

